Title: 200 AMSTERDAM: THE VERTICAL CITY
Credit: Written for the Screen by
Author: Danny Bouldiez
Episode: PART 07: WHEN THE EARTH OPENS (CHAPTER 06)

====

INT. SUB-LEVEL 6 - BEDROCK VAULT - NIGHT

Pitch black except for the amber glow of emergency beacons. 

Water is ankle-deep. Cold. Silty Hudson River water bubbling up through fractures in the solid granite foundation.

MARCUS and DEVS ONE wade through the water in rubber boots.

                         MARCUS
          Look at the bedrock anchor bolts!

Marcus shines his high-powered flashlight on Anchor Bolt #4. 

A 12-INCH SOLID STEEL BOLT, torqued to four million foot-pounds. 

SOUND: *BANG!* Like an artillery shell detonating in an enclosed room.

The steel bolt SHEARS IN HALF, ricocheting off the concrete bulkhead and splashing into the water.

The entire 70-story building GROANS above them—a sound of immense, twisting agony.

                         DEVS ONE
          (screaming into his radio)
          BMS CONTROL! EVACUATE THE TOWER! THE FOUNDATION HAS SHEARED!

The radio crackles with static. Then the main power grid FAILS. 

Total, terrifying darkness.

FADE TO BLACK.
